WEBVTT

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.510
I'm off!

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.390
Mornin', Soichiro.
Wanna play when I get home?

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:18.360
Mornin', Manager!
See ya later!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.370
Have a good day!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.040
Happy as usual.
Right, Soichiro?

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.220
Good morning.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.620
G-Good morning.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.560
I guess I'll be off.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.060
H-Have a nice day.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.140
I wonder who that was.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.140
Your lunch!

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.340
Father, you
forgot your lunch!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.910
"F-Father"!?

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:14.550
Forget your lunch,
and your whole day's ruined.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.950
Your tie's all crooked--

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.490
Lift your chin.
Jeez, your neck is short.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.590
There ya go.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:28.100
H-He's Mrs. Ichinose's husband?

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.670
Soichiro, I'm home!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.680
I'll come out and
play in a minute.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.080
I'm home!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.330
Ma--

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.670
Ma!
Ma!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.820
What's wrong, Kentaro.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.120
Git to school.
You're gonna be late.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.580
What're you talking about!?
It's nighttime already!

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:02.850
Yer right.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.530
Ain't no use in
showin' you this, huh?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.500
Show me what?

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.540
What's this?
A sports fair?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.640
A permission slip
to let you race?

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.710
Parents' Three-Legged Race.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.720
Is the prize
a bottle o' booze?

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:44.810
It's only you.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.170
What's with you?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.280
Say "welcome home,"
like you should...

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.810
...or you won't grow up
handsome like me!

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:55.840
Kentaro!

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.150
I'm home.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.980
Dad, welcome home!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.150
Kinda late today?

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.520
I'm early!

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.580
Maybe.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.100
The company's bankrupt!?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.610
And?

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.550
What're we supposed
to do now, father?

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.780
You got somethin'
else lined up?

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:38.150
I've been checking
the want ads.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.190
Anything promising?

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.060
Not so far.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:56.320
Can't be helped. It's not like
you drove them outta business.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.340
So go to unemployment, huh?

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:04.680
Right.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.630
What!? You want me
to run the race?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:24.200
But your parents will
be at the fair, right?

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:29.740
Ma'll probably get plastered
before the race starts.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.410
And Dad...

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.920
...might not be
able to make it.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:39.210
But is it okay?
If I enter--

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.450
It's fine! I'll say you're
my brother and sister.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.490
"Brother"?

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.220
Big Brother Godai!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.560
Godai and I are family?

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.870
Your big brother would
be glad to help.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:59.810
I'm a busy man, but at the
request of a little brother--

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.840
My joy for you
is boundless, Godai!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.330
This calls for
a celebration!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.710
Oh no! I'm saving that
for a party next week--

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.920
C'mon! Stingy--

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:14.890
No way!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:15.990
Mister!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.390
Yes? Come in.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.890
Is my son in here?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.600
Dad, didja find work yet?

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.110
No, nothing today.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.410
Oh. Okay.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:37.180
I'm sorry to have
bothered you. Good night.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.340
You don't suppose that was--

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:44.990
The pater of Young Kentaro?

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.960
Meaning that he's
Mrs. Ichinose's...

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.430
...HUSBAND!?

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:52.430
He actually exists.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.200
Kentaro...

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.070
...there's a sports fair?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.800
Y-You saw the
permission slip?

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.580
Should we enter the
3-legged race?

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.510
I don't have to work.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.980
Don't put yourself out.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.420
One day won't hurt anything.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:20.220
But if you pair up with
Ma when she's drunk--

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.790
But if you--

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.260
I'm okay with it!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.900
About that 3-legged race--

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:15.070
The one at Kentaro's school?

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.470
You think we could
make a go of it?

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.620
I think you should worry
about finding work, first.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.750
The bills from the liquor shop
are due soon.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.080
I just thought...

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.420
...we really should
put in an appearance.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.030
Don't be stupid. He doesn't
take that kinda thing to heart.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.670
Greetings.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.300
G-Good morning.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.800
Off to work?

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:10.200
In a sense.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.750
Oh, good morning!

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.720
Good morning.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.220
I must take my leave.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:32.780
Take care!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:37.030
She is quite serious about
training for the sports fair.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.800
"S-Sporrts fair"?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.700
Hadn't you heard?

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:48.400
Kentaro has recruited her to
participate in a sports fair.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:49.570
Is that so?

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:56.180
So that's why Kentaro--

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:05.790
The autumn sports meet;
A trickle of fine liquor;
The pickled who fall.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:30.410
Go Kentaro!
Run your butt off!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.170
Haven't been to
a sports meet in ages!

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.670
So let's have a blast!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.020
Ma! Cut it out!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:52.170
Cut what out!?
I'm here to cheer you on!

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.570
Don't go bustin' into
other people's picnics...

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.310
...or askin' people you
don't know for booze!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.520
I would never do
somethin' like that!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:05.650
It's because you always do it
that I gotta tell you not to!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.220
But are you
sure you want us?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.820
But after your father
came to all the way here--

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.930
Right, Godai?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.960
Y--Yeah--

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:22.430
You're not thinkin', Manager!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.640
If Ma goes paradin' around
the schoolyard all drunk...

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.640
...it won't be
just a family problem.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.180
I'll never be
able to live it down.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.870
He's right.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:32.980
Godai!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:40.050
And you trained so
hard every day for it!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:42.760
I did say I would--

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.560
I don't expect my parents
to be good at anything.

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.330
Don't be so worried about
hurtin' their feelings.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.030
I'm countin on you!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:52.990
Ken--

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:17.510
Kentaro acts strong, but I'm sure
he wants his parents in the race.

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.260
I guess you're right.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.960
E-Excuse me--

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.150
Go ahead.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.600
Maybe we should
have turned him down.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.580
B-But then, Kentaro
wouldn't have anybody!

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:39.680
That's true.
That would be worse.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.550
Let's do our best
and take first prize!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.380
Sure!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.620
I'll count to 3. Left leg first.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:51.790
--Yeah. He wants his folks.
--Okay?

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.550
1 , 2 and 3!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:57.760
Ow-w-w!

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.590
Godai! I said your left leg!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.270
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.000
Let's try it again.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:05.700
Okay!

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.880
C'mon, you guys,
you can do it!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.480
Chuck 'em in!
We gotta win this!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:31.260
One, two. One, two.
One, two. One, two.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.300
One, two. One, two--

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.770
There you go, Godai!
That's the way!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:36.530
Yeah!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.000
One, two. One, two.
One, two.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.300
One, two--

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.500
Godai--

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.280
It's my fault.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.210
I'm so sorry!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.500
Oww!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.330
Don't whine!
You're a big boy now!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:23.910
Attention three-legged racers,
you are needed at the gate.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:29.320
Please come to
the course immediately.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:33.920
To repeat: Attention
three-legged racers--

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.690
Where's the manager?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:41.260
I must inform you that I am
not the manager's manager.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.530
What's that mean?

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.630
Looks like it's our turn.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:46.670
Father?

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.370
Go for it, guys!

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.380
Ma!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.210
What?

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.690
Don't do it!
You're drunk!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:01.620
Stupid. I haven't been drinkin'.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:08.280
Your ma and I had a no-drinking policy
before the race.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:11.030
But you had that bottle--

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.120
And just water in it!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:21.770
Blow into these.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.080
What a cynical kid!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.960
Well?
Feel better?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.200
Get set--

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.870
Go, Mrs. Ichinose!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.700
I must say, they're
out of the gate well.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:23.560
Them?

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.930
I'm amazed they haven't
fallen on their butts.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.630
It shows how
in-tune they are!

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:38.220
Father, ain't it over yet?

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.820
We just got started!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.480
I'm about to die!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.080
Get the thing off us!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.120
They're gaining!

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:25.200
Such an admirable effort!

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:26.490
You can do it!

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:59.260
You're almost there!
One more obstacle to go!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:21.280
I-I think I'm gonna die.
You owe me a drink--

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.400
I'm dead!
I'm so beat!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:31.900
Gimme some booze!

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:06.790
--The winners! We're #1 !
--Stop it Ma! It's embarrassin'!

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:10.230
Mrs. Ichinose, one more?
You look parched.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:14.730
You gotta have a
new respect for your Ma.

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:19.610
You gotta be kiddin'!
Ma, that's enough. Cut it out!

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:23.350
She was pretty worried, too.

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:26.680
I must say that
I envy you two.

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:38.390
Father! Father!
Come here and have a belt!

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:48.140
Just a small one. You gotta
hit unemployment tomorrow.

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:50.870
Lemme do it!

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:54.220
You serve him
but not me?

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:58.470
Nobody can keep
your glass full!

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:07.350
That's gross!

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:11.290
Godai, kindly refrain from
infecting us with your germs!

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:13.800
We might all become
starving students.

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:18.110
I ain't cleanin' up
your mess, Godai!

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:25.270
Now it's time to dance!

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.840
The moment we've
been waiting for!

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:31.880
Don't do it, Ma!
It's embarrassing!

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:35.120
I'm beggin', Ma!
C'mon!

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:52.170
It's the Clock Hill Merchants'
Autumn Street Fair.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:53.580
Complete with
a haunted house!

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:57.310
They asked me to
play leading role!

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.500
But I'm going
to miss my cue--

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:03.880
Next: "Mixed-Up Autumn Festival!
Alone in the Well with Kyoko"

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.250
"l'm so lonely"!
